# Build outputs
/uplink
/uplink.exe
/composer.exe
*.test.exe
/dist/

# The first-boot agent: compiled by ./build-agent.sh and embedded, never
# committed. Its directory keeps a README so the embed always has a file.
internal/agentbin/bin/*.gz
internal/agentbin/bin/sources.sha256

# Test artifacts (S1 media images are multi-hundred-MB)
*.img
*.vhd
s1-result.txt

# Where test/autoinstall/vm.sh works when it is given no directory. Holds
# ISOs, installed disks and built media -- 24 GB after a few cases, all of it
# untracked, so `git add -A` in a repo someone has tested in tries to commit
# the lot. (CI passes $RUNNER_TEMP/ai and never creates this.)
/autoinstall-work/
